      "position": [
        700,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 👔 Step 2: Legal CEO Extraction\nVisits each company website's /impressum to legally extract the Managing Director (Geschäftsführer) name, direct email, and VAT ID under § 5 DDG.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 280,
